L1: Early administration of vitamin C in patients with sepsis or septic shock in emergency departments: a multicenter, double-blind, randomized controlled trial: the C-EASIE trial
L2: Critical Care (2025)
L3: Stefanie Vandervelden, Bente Cortens, Steffen Fieuws, Wilma Eegdeman, Stefano Malinverni, Philippe Vanhove, Koen Monsieurs, Jan Breuls, Ives Hubloue, François Stifkens, Jacques Creteur, Lina Wauters, Didier Desruelles
