L600: | LABORATORY |  |  |  |  |  |  |
L601: | CRP, haematology, chemistry, kidney and bilirubin |  | X | X | X |  |  |
L602: | Procalcitonine |  | X | X (day 4) |  |  |  |
L603: | ABG |  | X | Daily in ICU (on ward only if clinically indicated) | In ICU (on ward only if clinically indicated) |  |  |
